    <h1>Multi-Firm Feature Subscription &amp; Provisioning</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"MultiFirmFeatureSubscription&amp;Provisioning-ParentFirm"=
>Parent Firm</h1>
<p>:warning: Pending individual app feasibility assessment - potential limi=
ters can include apps that 1) require firm type as context 2) require firm-=
specific business rules 3)&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"58eac10d-b406-4d36-b226-9a74867436cf">Parent firm require=
s a modified core package with only features that work in aggregate</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1f9aa4b5-2812-4343-baa3-abe33cbb0ecc">Add-on features can=
 mostly all be made available to parent &amp; vice versa unless limited to =
the child firm</li>
</ul>
