<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmFeatureSubscription&amp;Provisioning-FeatureRelationship=
"><span>Feature Relationship</span></h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1b912190-ecc5-4664-a432-0d69e184074f"><span>Contracts are=
 established at the registered firm-level for billing; t</span><span>here a=
re different ways for features to be billed</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7859ea07-2bef-43aa-95e2-dd30bb2688b8"><span>Once a firm f=
orms / joins&nbsp;a parent group, feature availability across firms should =
be harmonized (<strong>not assigned</strong>, just made available) in the e=
vent the parent group decides to cascade features across firms</span></li>
</ul>
